{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0184_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d6246bffc7a31b5142039648786dd17df59b4dc6a614221c61dcca159da11d41", "ja": "（育のPV撮影が終わった。本人は、少し難しく\n感じていたみたいだけど……いい物になりそうだな）", "zh": "（育的PV拍摄结束了。她本人好像觉得有点难……不过应该能拍出不错的作品吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0184_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d17c3c42c526c5eff7ba76f31953359d7a287065241f84694db3964bb2df3087", "ja": "育、お疲れさま……あれ？　さっきまで\nそこにいたはずなのに、どこに行ったんだ？", "zh": "育，辛苦了……咦？刚才明明还在那里的，她去哪儿了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0184_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "a44e1fdd13dc8cd2c7eb7399ca88b777d57389f1be7582821f024be0debf1a2e", "ja": "どうしよう……。\n何がいいのかなぁ……うーん……。", "zh": "怎么办才好……\n选什么好呢……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0184_1003_p", "source_sha256": "44e8fda6f7b7ed30c24b1584419851a1f3bafdcf44a89b9d3ac1c95dc4b729d9", "ja": "あ、育。こっちにいたのか。", "zh": "啊，育。原来你在这儿啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0184_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "a5dff1c3e5aee812fbb42fd19f34d51025c0c3e5ee2fea2de7674e39efdd6cca", "ja": "あっ……{$P$}さん！\n今の、聞こえちゃった？", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生！\n刚才的话，你听到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0184_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0b12ff4d060e6a65eae97531f4230e1533e406c1d4effc620bb56191474bd5e4", "ja": "なんだか、悩んでるみたいな声が聞こえたような……。\nどうかしたのか？　何かあるなら、相談に乗るけど。", "zh": "总觉得好像听到了你烦恼的声音……。\n怎么了？要是有什么事，我可以听你倾诉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0184_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "600874b9912cedf6e9b8e1670eceec49a232af4d49edfdd42712d1cd37f7fa46", "ja": "やっぱり聞こえちゃったんだ！　うう～、どうしよう。\nナイショでなきゃ、ダメだったのに……。", "zh": "果然还是被听到了啊！呜呜～，怎么办。\n明明必须要保密的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0184_1007_p", "source_sha256": "fa36f4b65db2349aae5bef3d06dde48e2fff8a398a00b71652e07bb2c645efb0", "ja": "よくわからないけど……\n何か、内緒にする必要がある事なのか？", "zh": "虽然不太明白……  \n是有什么需要保密的事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0184_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "95e90a50540db71803dec9d759cada09ff16d72b2b0274e1cad96e2cb5cf34ee", "ja": "そうだよ！　ナイショじゃなかったら、\nサプライズにならないでしょ？", "zh": "就是啊！要是不保密的话，就不能算是惊喜了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0184_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4d4b60ef335245cd001b69057a0d45b7f9365842f3612e833688721540bacf55", "ja": "サプライズ？", "zh": "惊喜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0184_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "88c238508a4360b5b8f87242e77f3942902a96bcca0947f296bd9d140c4f4f6f", "ja": "あっ！　言っちゃった……うぅ……。", "zh": "啊！说出来了……呜……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0184_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "bad82a0c48695387d7ef750592dd5f7cdc5a3f0ddf8f3930c50e4d91a5dfcbaf", "ja": "あのね。今回の撮影でわたし、{$P$}\nさんに、いっぱい助けてもらったから……。", "zh": "那个……这次拍摄中，我得到了{$P$}先生很多帮助，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0184_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "edceb7071f24abe615769cf86617ed7c6fdb560994b4598838c8476011bd6ef7", "ja": "何か、お礼をしなくちゃって思って。\nそれでスタッフさんたちに、相談したんだけど……。", "zh": "我觉得得做点什么表示感谢才行。所以我去和工作人员们商量了一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0184_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1f3c1594bed87aa8cc3e6b199f607f1c5b6f348d5dff6d587166fd3a5adbea9b", "ja": "なるほど、サプライズで何かしてくれようとしたのか。\nはは、ありがとうな、育！", "zh": "原来如此，你是想给我准备什么惊喜啊。\n哈哈，谢谢你，育！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0184_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "3fe15a1b7fbb49b42f8d3b1d1aa1ab29832879790e56c89e967480b089f2221c", "ja": "{$P$}さん……でもわたし、\n何もしてないよ？　サプライズ、失敗しちゃったし。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……可是我，什么都没做呀？惊喜也失败了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0184_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "34001aad9fb0a27f7b9ede49f1aae3a37e621fcfffa203cf3b9d86c004a66ac0", "ja": "きちんと感謝の気持ちを伝えるのって、お仕事では\nすごく大事なんだって。おかあさんが言ってたよ！", "zh": "妈妈说过，好好表达感谢之情，在工作中是非常重要的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0184_1016_p", "source_sha256": "537eca2d3ee35fd4351e2710e57e66ef33e9344d86bb89fba08439fd82e0340d", "ja": "うん。それはそうなんだけど……\nでも今は、育のその気持ちだけで十分なんだよ。", "zh": "嗯。话是这么说没错……\n不过现在，只要有育的这份心意就足够了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0184_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "8e3fe9e64843278b901849a890b248bfb3d18bf612c5d3a62b11461db31678f2", "ja": "む～……わかった。\n今回は、お礼言うだけにする……。", "zh": "唔～……知道了。\n这次就只说声谢谢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0184_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "7d306a729abcd838284a0d505ec5b387d2f3e3f95f572537d812c79e359f7dfd", "ja": "えっと……{$P$}さん！\nたくさんわたしの話を聞いてくれて、ありがとう！", "zh": "那个……{$P$}先生！\n谢谢你听我说了这么多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0184_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "79641251e9e927c74b3246936a42756da48c7b192f62162fb53f3339da5129ba", "ja": "次はぜったい、サプライズしてみせるからね！\n楽しみにしててね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "下次我一定会给你一个惊喜的！\n敬请期待吧，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
